Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Since ancient times, the Sirius have chosen a member of their royal family by oracle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and revered them as an agent of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.01,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As a mark of kingship,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:20.58,Default,,2,2,0,,they were permitted to possess the Ark that could exert its\Npower over all things, which the Sirius claimed was a gift from God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what they called the Ark of Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.02,0:00:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the tomb of that royal family?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.65,0:00:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like this place was ransacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think the vampires didn't notice it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When they didn't find the Ark upstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,they probably assumed that this was just a tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But if my interpretation of the ancient text is correct...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.79,0:00:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.59,0:01:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.89,0:01:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A shrine made in the style of the original holy grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.06,0:01:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like a auxiliary holy ground, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.94,0:01:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.75,0:01:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The place said to be the origin of the Sirius and the place where the Ark was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.94,0:01:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's also the only place where the Ark can be sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.07,0:01:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So then the real holy ground is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,In South Karafuto, most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.07,0:01:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,For some unknown reason, the Sirius had to leave their homeland in the distant past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:45.48,Default,,2,2,0,,They supposedly forged a treasure that would facilitate the\Nmove from the holy grounds—a counterpart to the Ark.{"so that they could take the Ark with them"? also, do you know anything about what "paired" implies?}{your line literally doesn't fit and I don't know how to edit it down.}{}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.97,0:01:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a secret shrine made to hold that treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.47,0:01:54.94,Default,,2,2,0,,That treasure, known only to the keepers of the Ark\Nwho forged it and their true heirs, is here somewhere.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:02:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"This vessel was created by means unknown to us."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"By its power, the Divine Ark may be suppressed and sent away." {Where "that land" is is unclear, might be Karafuto, might be heaven?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.76,0:02:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.{I knew it, this is it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If the seal on the Ark in the true holy grounds is undone,{i think it's fine to mix in holy land when they're far away from sakhalin}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.29,0:02:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that Yuliy will have need of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.81,0:02:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.95,0:02:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I was thinking I'd be able to get home to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.31,0:02:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're heading to where Yuliy is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oooh, I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.43,0:04:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting so, so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.40,0:04:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.69,0:04:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they vampires or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me just go ahead and introduce myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Klarwein!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The masses, mistaking the fruits of my labor for magic, have taken to calling me the Wizard,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but I am nothing other than an ultra-genius scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Scientist?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me you made vampires into these robot things? {Cyborg was coined in the sixties it seems.}{lmao, that attention to detail. It's an interesting question as to whether/when we need to be limited to 1930 English--are these characters not talking in 2018 Japanese? That said, I don't mind this choice.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The trial run with a human worked, so this time I mass-produced them using vampires!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't they wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, it's time for the live-combat testing I've been {\i1}so{\i0} looking forward to!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.09,0:05:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We've found more infected?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Just a few, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're being quarantined on the lowest deck.{I'm just cutting every "it seems" on sight pretty much}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's too afraid of getting infected to get near them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.67,0:05:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like my little honey bunnys?{yes, yes, I know, but "my honeys" is not a thing in english afaik. alt term: honey bunny}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.24,0:05:30.30,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,You know, if I didn't give these bodies such a drastic makeover, they'd have died long ago!{idk if "long ago" is accurate, but if I don't say that, I don't know how to make sure the viewer doesn't think he's talking about them falling in battle to Yuliy rather than the disease}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.30,0:05:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Have I caught your interest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.14,0:05:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll explain, you ignorant, uneducated fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Our vampire friends are suffering from a fatal disease right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.45,0:05:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,, Nobody understands the where or why of the source!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.94,0:05:50.23,Default,,2,2,0,,They're so worried about when they'll be infected with the\Nmysterious disease that they can't even get a good night's sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They're vampires, so they'd be sleeping during the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A fatal disease?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.13,0:05:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,For vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:05:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.89,0:06:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Their inability to cure it drove them to beg for my assistance with tears in their eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But since the moment that {*}Lord Yevgraf{*Yevgraf-sama} found the Ark of Sirius,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,he's refused to even acknowledge the existence of my wonderful project!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.82,0:06:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that's awful?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks that he'll be able to cure the disease with the power of the Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.64,0:06:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though we don't even have a clear idea of what it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What a foolish, unscientific way to think!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be better for it to stay sealed for all eternity!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:31.94,Default,,2,2,0,,{\an8}That way the vampires would realize just how wonderful my inventions are,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and {\i1}beg{\i0} me to help them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.49,0:06:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So, for the sake of having {*}Lord Yevgraf{*Yevgraf-sama} understand the value of my sweethearts, please die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.61,0:07:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? What are you {\i1}doing{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold still for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.69,0:07:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you, a puppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.45,0:07:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And another!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bishop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My super-genius inventions are going to be lost to time because of a stupid thing like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I won't accept it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.41,0:07:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.93,0:07:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd have any problems dodging it. {The flamethrower}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you picking a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That disease he was talking about...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.55,0:08:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A fatal disease that only vampires get,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.63,0:08:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and one so bad that they need to rely on a mysterious, borderline-occult power to cure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.50,0:08:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty pathetic, if you ask me.{is he saying "sucks to be them"?}{"that sentece contains elemends of both sympahisizing with them and shitting on them but shitting on them is much stronger"}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.16,0:08:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamara, is the Ark of Sirius still sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll wake it up soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, {*}Lord Yev{*Yev-sama}?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The men we quarantined have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.87,0:08:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't ashify. Their bodies are still intact.{They used a made up word so I made up a word. If you have a better word then go for it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care when disposing of the corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.49,0:08:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Larissa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we gonna die like that too when we get sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:09:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure hope not! I don't want to die like a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, {*}Lord—{*Yev—}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.64,0:09:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to be by myself for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.39,0:09:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a thousand years since the blood pact freed me from humanity's{the human's} irksome yoke.{humanity's? that is, he was disgusted with being a human?}{"possibly that, but I feel like him having been actually enslaved in some fashion is more likely"}{making a judgment call here on the basis that I was struck by how amazing the idea of humanity being a "yoke" to yevgraf was. much more interesting than some potential backstory about him being enslaved would be. if I turn out to be wrong, you can make fun of me.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I became an immortal vampire, and ruled for a time that had no end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.39,0:09:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It was truly a blessed time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.53,0:09:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is how it ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is our blood really this fragile?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we no different from our livestock,\Nthose foolish humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.31,0:09:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I just accept that as fate,\Nas the senile old men say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.87,0:09:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.10,0:09:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I will keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:10:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I become the last vampire,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.69,0:10:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,even if I must use the power of the inferior Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,With my hands, with my own\Nnoble blood, I will change this fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's where the Ark of Sirius{PLEASE}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.21,0:10:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and Dad are!{DON'T DO THIS JAPAN}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just screaming "Ahead lies the Ark," isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.56,0:10:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This place feels eerie as all hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you eager?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.93,0:11:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you telling me to stay away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.74,0:11:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.31,0:11:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing about Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.85,0:11:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}nothing about my race.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.89,0:11:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So as the last remnant of the Sirius,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.15,0:11:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.14,0:11:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't you agree, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.16,0:12:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.58,0:12:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.85,0:12:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect Yuliy and Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.47,0:13:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a really nice place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost feel like I'm back in my homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.04,0:13:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved my sons' lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't have anywhere better to go,\Nthen you can stay here forever if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.02,0:13:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.61,0:13:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Alexei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.58,0:13:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have business that I need to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.02,0:13:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark of Sirius?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.81,0:13:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have secret orders to find and appropriate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.84,0:13:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I was having no luck, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.89,0:13:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,By pure chance, I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:38.72,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I didn't tell you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to deceive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.48,0:13:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I've grown so fond of Dogville, and if I steal the ark, I'll be breaking the peace here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.65,0:13:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Akasaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.10,0:14:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Every major power, not just Japan,\Nis secretly searching for the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before they reach this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Alexei,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,when that happens, will you be able to protect your Ark?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.37,0:14:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He was completely open with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does Akasaka have to be—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Any who learn of the Ark, and any who wish to take the Ark, must be buried along with their knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.74,0:14:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one of our most ancient laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.58,0:14:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So that the royal family that protects the Ark may have a peaceful rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.55,0:14:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,their followers have enforced that law for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.27,0:14:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not wish for that man's death either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that the Ark is important to our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But can any object be so important that we have to sacrifice outsiders' lives to protect it?{YES, dude! Yes! It can!}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.42,0:14:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we kill Akasaka, someone else will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.55,0:14:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we going to do such a fruitless thing every time that happens?{YES, dude! Foreign spies are executed all the damn time! Maybe don't get attached to them}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.27,0:15:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what hardships befall us, the Sirius will live here with the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the pride of the Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Our pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.72,0:15:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me that killing God-knows-how-many people for the Ark will be our pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The village accepted Sachi—accepted a human into their ranks as my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You yourself were the one who affirmed that decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We will co-exist with humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that our new pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.60,0:15:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to do something that would destroy that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.89,0:15:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Gustav.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.62,0:15:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to seal the Ark of Sirius away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sirius need to break away from our old conventions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.31,0:15:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that would be what's best for our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.79,0:15:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So Gustav,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,teach me how to seal the Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.94,0:15:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:15:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our only option!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:15:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Gustav...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.66,0:16:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it to Karafuto. {Every episode this show finds new ways to make me regret fucking up Karafuto}{Like I said before, don't stress over it}{ok, to future people working with these subs, japanese viewers will know that sakhalin = karafuto, but us geographically-challenge ameriburgers won't. Forgive us for prioritizing clarity.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.65,0:16:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the place of the Sirius' birth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and the holy land where the Ark came into being.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.14,0:16:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be possible to seal it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one with the blood of the royal family might be able to do it—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,that is to say, only you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:33.19,Default,,2,2,0,,It's said that in the past, we were able to undo the seal\Nand bring the Ark here by releasing the king's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.19,0:16:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wish to seal it again, Alexei,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.69,0:16:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what will become of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.70,0:16:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is sealing the Ark the right choice even if it means exposing yourself to danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.25,0:16:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider that question well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.79,0:16:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:52.83,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If that will let them live with the new pride of the Sirius in their hearts...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come back as soon as the Ark is sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take too long, Yuliy will forget you, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.19,0:17:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.31,0:17:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} won't forget me, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.72,0:17:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so strange sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.48,0:17:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you mean, "I'll see you later"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.15,0:17:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.31,0:17:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.80,0:17:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.60,0:17:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!{Three Dads in a row, can we keep the combo going?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.59,0:17:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad! {Oh shit we can}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.37,0:18:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.79,0:18:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that everything you wanted to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.91,0:18:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happened now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.65,0:18:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's all you wanted, then go on home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.60,0:18:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to be like this forever, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.41,0:18:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sealing the Ark means releasing the soul of its protector.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My soul exists alongside the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand what that implies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.64,0:18:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But that means you'll be left with this tragedy forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.07,0:18:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,After you left the village, Dogville was attacked by vampires seeking the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.27,0:19:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, Gustav, and everyone else died.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.24,0:19:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Mikhail{*Nii-san} risked his life to protect me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but he became a vampire as a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You sacrificed your life for the sake of our happiness—for the sake of the Sirius' future—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.85,0:19:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.21,0:19:20.11,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,How can I live with something this cruel?{idk. passive voice active voice blah blah blah}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.88,0:19:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why you called this a tragedy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Much has been sacrificed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but this seal is protecting the peace of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.25,0:19:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Its present and future peace both.{ww2 literally happens a decade later}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"No matter what hardships befall us,\Nthe Sirius will live here with the Ark."{is there a quoting particle or something here? well, it works way better a quote, so I understand either way}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If shackling me to that old tradition will let the Sirius part ways with it, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.90,0:19:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,As your father, I don't want these shackles to ever bind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Please understand, Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:19:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't make a mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.68,0:19:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's fundamentally the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.27,0:20:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As she lay dying, Mom said "live" to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.40,0:20:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand what she meant now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She wanted me to live and complete what you wanted to accomplish!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.33,0:20:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wrong that anyone should ever have to be a sacrifice for the sake of someone else's happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.58,0:20:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.79,0:20:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to find a way other than sealing the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll live in order to prove that the the new pride of the Sirius that you showed us was the right one!{}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that the day would come that I'd get preached to by little Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's thanks to Mom and {*}Mikhail{*Nii-san}.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.18,0:20:52.69,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Mom taught me your stature,\Nand {*}Mikhail{*Nii-san} taught me your strength.{stature?}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.69,0:20:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They raised me and passed your will on together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:20:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.17,0:21:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You just might be able to do what I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.01,0:21:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.85,0:21:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.14,0:21:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be watching over you with Mom as you find your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.33,0:21:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.76,0:21:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.95,0:21:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting, it's starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.62,0:21:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.16,0:21:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.33,0:21:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ark of the Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.70,0:23:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to settle the score myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.86,0:23:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.49,0:23:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, {*}Brother{*Nii-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All we needed was for you to stay out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.47,0:23:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
